Striker: score more {{Goals}} than defenders, so don't let defenders have more {{Goals}} than strikers. in this game it will run according to the year or {{Age}} of the player in the game. Every 1 year a striker can score 1-100 {{Goals}}, so please choose really randomly. and for {{Assist}} a striker has fewer {{Assists}} than a defender, that is, in 1 year you will only get 1-30 {{Assists}} which are chosen randomly. 

Defender: scored fewer {{Goals}} than strikers, i.e. in 1 year only scored 1-30 {{Goals}} randomly. However, he has more {{Assists}} than strikers, namely 1-50 {{Asists}} in one year randomly.

The age system or {{Age}} will start from the age of 16 and will continue to play until the age of 35. every time I input "next" the age will increase and {{Goals}} and {{Assists}} also increase randomly according to the system. 

